## API endpoints

All requests/responses are JSON. Protected endpoints need
`Authorization: Bearer <token>` in the header.

| Method | Path                              | Auth     | Description                          |
|--------|-----------------------------------|----------|--------------------------------------|
| POST   | /api/auth/register                | Public   | Create account, returns JWT          |
| POST   | /api/auth/login                   | Public   | Login, returns JWT                   |
| GET    | /api/auth/health                  | Public   | Health check                         |
| GET    | /api/providers                    | Token    | All providers (filterable)           |
| GET    | /api/providers?pending=true       | Token    | Providers awaiting approval          |
| GET    | /api/providers?categoryId=1       | Token    | Approved providers in a category     |
| GET    | /api/providers/{id}               | Token    | One provider                         |
| PUT    | /api/providers/{id}/approve       | ADMIN    | Approve a pending provider           |
| PUT    | /api/providers/{id}/rating        | Internal | Called by Booking Service on review  |

