## What's NOT included

This is a Cycle 1 starter. Things you may add later:

- Refresh tokens (current tokens last 24h, then user must log in again)
- Email verification on register
- Password reset flow
- Profile editing endpoint
- Provider availability toggle endpoint
- Image upload for `image_url`

All of those are valid Cycle 2 features and should go into NEW
endpoints or new tables, never by altering the frozen schema.

