When the Booking Service inserts a review:

1. Calculate the new average rating for that provider locally.
2. Call `PUT http://localhost:8081/api/providers/{id}/rating` with
   body `{ "rating": 4.6 }`.
3. No JWT needed on this internal call in Cycle 1 (the endpoint is
